        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Brand Strength — We Measure the Levers for Sustainable Demand</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #000;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    width: 1024px;\n    height: 576px;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .slide { position: relative; width: 1024px; height: 576px; padding: 28px 40px 0 70px; }\n\n  .kicker {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: .2px;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    color: #e8102a;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 0;\n    letter-spacing: -0.2px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- main three-zone layout ---------- */\n  .body-grid {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n  }\n  .col-people { width: 190px; position: relative; }\n  .col-internal { width: 330px; padding-left: 6px; }\n  .col-external { width: 380px; }\n\n  /* ---------- people icons ---------- */\n  .person-block { text-align: center; }\n  .person-block.employees { margin-top: 26px; }\n  .person-block.customers { margin-top: 88px; }\n  .person-label { font-size: 15px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .person-sub { font-size: 11px; color: #cfcfcf; }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #2a1414;\n    border: 1px dashed #6b3b3b;\n    color: #b98a8a;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .person-icon {\n    width: 46px; height: 92px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .factors-label {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: .5px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- item rows ---------- */\n  .item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .thumb {\n    width: 54px; height: 54px;\n    flex: 0 0 54px;\n    margin-right: 10px;\n  }\n  .item-text { flex: 1 1 auto; }\n  .item-text.ruled { border-top: 1px solid #6a6a6a; padding-top: 3px; }\n  .item h3 {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .item p {\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #e6e6e6;\n  }\n\n  /* internal column offsets to mirror image */\n  .col-internal .item.clarity { margin-top: 0; }\n  .col-internal .item.responsiveness { margin-top: 26px; }\n\n  /* external column: first item sits higher */\n  .col-external { margin-top: -78px; }\n  .col-external .item.understanding { margin-top: 22px; }\n\n  /* the internal/external axis labels sit between rows */\n  .axis-internal { margin-top: 6px; }\n  .axis-external { margin-top: 4px; }\n\n  .logo {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 42px;\n    bottom: 24px;\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    letter-spacing: .3px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"slide\">\n\n  <p class=\"kicker\">BRAND STRENGTH</p>\n  <h1>WE MEASURE THE LEVERS FOR SUSTAINABLE DEMAND</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"body-grid\">\n\n    <!-- ============ LEFT: people ============ -->\n    <div class=\"col-people\">\n      <div class=\"person-block employees\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder person-icon\">[Icon: person silhouette]</div>\n        <div class=\"person-label\">Employees</div>\n        <div class=\"person-sub\">(Current &amp; Prospective)</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"person-block customers\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder person-icon\">[Icon: person silhouette]</div>\n        <div class=\"person-label\">Customers</div>\n        <div class=\"person-sub\">(Current &amp; Prospective)</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ============ MIDDLE: internal factors ============ -->\n    <div class=\"col-internal\">\n\n      <div class=\"item clarity\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder thumb\">[Photo: person outdoors]</div>\n        <div class=\"item-text ruled\">\n          <h3>Clarity</h3>\n          <p>Clarity internally about what the brand stands for and its values,\n             positioning and proposition. Clarity too about target audiences,\n             customer insights and drivers. Because so much hinges on this, it is\n             vital that these are articulated and shared across the organization.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder thumb\">[Photo: hands]</div>\n        <div class=\"item-text ruled\">\n          <h3>Commitment</h3>\n          <p>Internal commitment to brand, and a belief internally\n             in the importance of brand. The extent to which the\n             brand receives support in terms of time, influence, and\n             investment.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder thumb\">[Photo: hand holding plant]</div>\n        <div class=\"item-text ruled\">\n          <h3>Protection</h3>\n          <p>How secure the brand is across a number of\n             dimensions: legal protection, proprietary ingredients\n             or design, scale or geographical spread.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"axis-internal factors-label\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:-52px 0 0 -140px; position:relative; width:140px;\">\n        INTERNAL<br>FACTORS\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item responsiveness\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder thumb\">[Photo: snowboarder]</div>\n        <div class=\"item-text ruled\">\n          <h3>Responsiveness</h3>\n          <p>The ability to respond to market changes. challenges and\n             opportunities. The brand should have a sense of leadership\n             internally and a desire and ability to constantly evolve and\n             renew itself.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ============ RIGHT: external factors ============ -->\n    <div class=\"col-external\">\n\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder thumb\">[Photo: red seal/wax]</div>\n        <div class=\"item-text ruled\">\n          <h3>Authenticity</h3>\n          <p>The brand is soundly based on an internal\n             truth and capability. It has a defined heritage and a well grounded\n             value set. It can deliver against the (high) expectations that customers\n             have of it.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder thumb\">[Photo: two people]</div>\n        <div class=\"item-text ruled\">\n          <h3>Relevance</h3>\n          <p>The fit with customer/consumer needs, desires, and\n             decision criteria across all relevant demographics and\n             geographies.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder thumb\">[Photo: yellow cars]</div>\n        <div class=\"item-text ruled\">\n          <h3>Differentiation</h3>\n          <p>The degree to which customers/\n             consumers perceive the brand to have a\n             differentiated positioning distinctive from the\n             competition.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"axis-external factors-label\" style=\"text-align:center; margin:-52px 0 0 -122px; position:relative; width:130px;\">\n        EXTERNAL<br>FACTORS\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder thumb\">[Photo: bottles on shelf]</div>\n        <div class=\"item-text ruled\">\n          <h3>Consistency</h3>\n          <p>The degree to which a brand is experienced\n             without fail across all touchpoints or formats.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder thumb\">[Photo: storefront sign]</div>\n        <div class=\"item-text ruled\">\n          <h3>Presence</h3>\n          <p>The degree to which a brand feels omnipresent and is\n             talked about positively by consumers, customers and\n             opinion formers in both traditional and social media.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"item understanding\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder thumb\">[Photo: people at counter]</div>\n        <div class=\"item-text ruled\">\n          <h3>Understanding</h3>\n          <p>The brand is not only recognised by customers,\n             but there is also an in-depth knowledge and under-standing of its\n             distinctive qualities and characteristics (Where relevant, this includes\n             consumer understanding of the company that owns the brand).</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"logo\">Interbrand</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
